  "correction_note": "2026-09-21: dense/sol references for 25 remapped cases (Sept-1 code generation, unreproducible) were regenerated with the Sept-13 snapshot pipeline; all paired metrics re-scored against them. Previous PSNR/SSIM/LPIPS values were deflated by the generation drift of the stale references. Spark-H3 renamed to Spark-H3-10pct; Spark-H3-20pct added; the \"1 - sparsity\" column is now \"density\". The Sol-H3 + Reblock + Reweight row was dropped from the tables on 2026-09-21; its rescore remains in sources (solrr_quality_rescore). DiT speedup column keeps its name; the text now states its equivalence to OpenVDN's NFE-normalized per-step speedup and lists s/NFE latencies.",
